# macOS
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride

# Editor / IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Obsidian (don't commit per-vault state)
.obsidian/workspace*
.obsidian/cache
.obsidian/community-plugins.json

# Personal data — must NEVER be committed to public repo
**/profile.md
**/sessions.md
**/program.md
**/vocabulary.md
**/context-snapshot.md
**/_shared/profile.md
**/_shared/schedule.md
**/Daily/
**/Inbox.md
**/Ideas/
**/Reading/
**/Archive/
**/drive-config.json
**/.cache/

# Templates and examples are OK; they don't have personal data
!templates/**/*.md
!examples/**/*.md

# Backup files
*.bak
*.backup
